        <p class="text-[16px] leading-[26px] text-foreground md:max-w-[520px]">Plain <code class="v1-inline-code">&lt;a href&gt;</code> remains browser-native hard navigation.</p>
        <Links href="/docs/contracts/navigation" class="v1-link">Navigation Contract →</Links>
      </div>
